  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CGIAR Reference group 2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CGIAR Referensgrupp 2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As the Swedish support to CGIAR has increased significantly, Sida has identified a need for additional expert support in the areas of research that CGIAR focuses. Hence, an expert reference group of leading Swedish scientist has been selected in order to support the assessment process for continued support to CGIAR, as well as to support in the follow up of essential dialogue with the system.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta nya s&#xE4;tt att hantera det svenska st&#xF6;det till CGIAR systemet har ett behov av experthj&#xE4;lp och r&#xE5;dgivning identifierats. En referensgrupp med ett mindre antal medlemmar (5-7) som kan bidra med att ta fram underlag f&#xF6;r bed&#xF6;mningar f&#xF6;r det fortsatta st&#xF6;det till CGIAR systemet samt att kunna bist&#xE5; Sida med r&#xE5;dgivning i dess dialog med systemet.</narrative>
  </description>
